# requires: saves
# character: demir
# Character lock (docs/CHARACTER_LOCK.md): Demir, a gun body, fights Lain (kotukoru_ai), Inzar's boss in the story (slot 26 =
# kayit25.sav, Kotukoru_d, as inzar_lain_boss). Lain's intro releases only Inzar's control gate (koruyucu_pasif, kotu_koruyucu.wdl:6486);
# the locked body obeys the story's gate (k22_body_*_pasif). Lain gets enemy type 1 for the bullet blood table (Ates_Et kan_mertip,
# skill2) and its bullet hits are recorded as firearm kind 2, the one Kotukoru_Yaralan handles. The body keeps the story's firearm
# (Aktif_Silah at entry), held with S and fired with D in rounds that re-aim; Return reloads. Kotukoru_Ol (lain_sona_erdi 1)
# returns the story to Demir and LY_HedefLevel 84 (Buyukes).
realtime off
load-save 25
wait until LY_AktifLevelID == 98 && level_yuklendi_ok == 1 && player != 0 timeout 7200
assert $level == "kotukoru_d.wmb"
assert Aktif_Player == 2 && lain_sona_erdi == 0
assert $character == 0 && $count(Oyuncu_Demir) == 1 && $count(oyuncu_koruyucu) == 0
find boss kotukoru_ai
assert @boss.skill2 == 1
wait until $movie timeout 1200
press Escape
wait until koruyucu_pasif == 0 && $movie == 0 timeout 1200
store w Aktif_Silah
assert @w >= 1 && @w <= 8
print S_Kursun_Sayisi[@w] + Kursun_Sayisi[@w]
store hp0 $health
wait until $health < @hp0 timeout 1800
capture lain_attacks_gun_body
down S
wait until silah_kaldir == 1 && player.skill32 >= 100 timeout 600
store b0 @boss.skill1
press-until D @boss.skill1 < @b0 timeout 900
turn-to @boss 15 timeout 900
store g $frame
press-until D @boss.skill1 <= 0 || player.skill1 <= 0 || $frame > @g + 240 timeout 600
press-until Return S_Kursun_Sayisi[@w] > 0 || Kursun_Sayisi[@w] == 0 || @boss.skill1 <= 0 timeout 300
turn-to @boss 15 timeout 900
store g $frame
press-until D @boss.skill1 <= 0 || player.skill1 <= 0 || $frame > @g + 240 timeout 600
press-until Return S_Kursun_Sayisi[@w] > 0 || Kursun_Sayisi[@w] == 0 || @boss.skill1 <= 0 timeout 300
